    "name": "Grooves & Gasoline Dreams",
    "overview": "In nostalgic North Carolina, the Wolfe brothers go hog wild for a time-travel pop-culture pick-complete with a garage full of vinyl and three collections under one roof. Down the road in Texas, the choice stockpile at Brad's Automotive features top-notch petroliana, awesome signs, and the holy grail of pinball machines.",
